  "plan": "Investigate the real storage: re-check df, look at mount points, find any large files, and check whether the tmpfs filesystems (/sys/fs/cgroup with 32G, /dev/shm 64M) are writable. This tells me whether I can install gcc into a tmpfs or whether I must free space on root. I'll also test writing a file to the tmpfs to confirm it's usable.",
