      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
      "keystrokes": "apt-get -o Dir::Cache::archives=/sys/fs/cgroup/aptarchives install -y gcc make wget 2>&1 | tail -8\n",
      "duration": 40.0
    }
  ]
}

{
  "analysis": "The install succeeded by pointing apt's cache to the 32G tmpfs at /sys/fs/cgroup/aptarchives, bypassing the false statvfs free-space check. gcc, make, wget installed. gcov ships with gcc. Now I need to verify the tools, then download SQLite source, compile with gcov instrumentation, and make it available in PATH.",
  "plan": "Verify gcc/make/wget/gcov are available. Then create /app/sqlite, download the SQLite amalgamation tarball with wget, extract it, and compile the sqlite3 CLI with --coverage (gcov instrumentation). I'll start by verifying tools and downloading the source.",
  "commands": [
    {
      "keystrokes": "which gcc gcov make wget; gcc --version | head -1; gcov --version | head -1\n",
      "duration": 0.1
    },
    {
