  "plan": "Extract sqlite.zip using python3. Verify the extracted files (sqlite3.c, shell.c, sqlite3.h). Then compile with -fprofile-arcs -ftest-coverage (gcov) and install to /usr/local/bin. I'll do the extraction now.",
